## 🧠 HOW TO START EACH SESSION

1. Open `optimization_plan.md.resolved` — find the first ⬜ in the tracker
2. Open the file listed in the batch for that page
3. Read the full component — identify which classes break on mobile
4. Fix only the mobile layout (add responsive prefixes, flex-wrap, card collapse)
5. Never change colors, never change desktop classes, never run scripts

