## 🏗️ CUSTOM-BUILT SECTIONS — NO EXTERNAL REFERENCE

> These sections were built from scratch with no comparable external UI to reference.
> Mobile behavior is reasoned **purely from the component code** itself.
> The goal is the same: preserve desktop, fix the mobile breakpoint only.

