### 7. ViewPlatformPreview — ⛔ DESKTOP ONLY (Skip on Mobile)

**File**: `components/sections/ViewPlatformPreview.tsx`

**What it is**: The complex interactive orbital/radial diagram showing stakeholders (Trustees, Finance & Exams, Students, Teachers, Parents, Operations Admins, Academic Leaders) rotating around the ClassGrid logo center. Took 2 days to build. No reference available. Highly custom canvas/SVG animation.

**Decision: HIDE ON MOBILE. Show on Desktop only.**

- Wrap the section in `<div className="hidden md:block">` in the parent page (`app/page.tsx`).
- No changes to the component itself.
- On mobile, users simply don't see this section — it's too complex to compress into a small screen meaningfully without a complete rebuild.
- This is the ONE exception to the optimization rule — hiding is the correct call here.

**Implementation**: 1 line change in `app/page.tsx` — find the `<ViewPlatformPreview ... />` render and wrap it.

---

### 8. ModulesGrid — Mobile Card Grid Tightening

**File**: `components/sections/ModulesGrid.tsx`

**Desktop behavior (KEEP AS-IS)**:
A filterable `BentoGrid` of module cards. Tab pills at the top filter by institution type (School / Junior College / Engineering / Coaching). Cards animate in/out with Framer Motion. "Load More" button at the bottom.

**Problem on mobile**:
- `PillTabs` filter row can overflow if there are many institution tabs — no horizontal scroll guarantee.
- "Load More" button has hardcoded `style={{ width: "220px" }}` which clips on very small screens (< 375px).
- Callout box at bottom: `p-10` is too much padding on mobile, `text-2xl` heading could be smaller.

**Mobile behavior to implement**:
- `PillTabs` container: add `overflow-x-auto whitespace-nowrap -mx-4 px-4` for edge-bleed horizontal scroll on mobile.
- "Load More" button: remove `style={{ width: "220px" }}`, replace with `className="w-full max-w-[220px]"`.
- Callout box: `p-10` → `p-6 sm:p-10`, `text-2xl` → `text-xl sm:text-2xl`.
- Verify `BentoGrid` already collapses to `grid-cols-1` on mobile (likely already works — audit before editing).

---

### 9. ClassgridRoleShowcase — Mobile Phone-First Layout

**File**: `components/sections/ClassgridRoleShowcase.tsx`

**Desktop behavior (KEEP AS-IS)**:
A 2-column layout: left is a `2×3` grid of clickable feature cards, right is an iPhone 15 Pro mockup. Three role tabs at top (Faculty | Student | Parent) switch the view with spring animation.

**Problem on mobile**:
- On mobile, the grid collapses to 1 column: feature cards on top, phone mockup below. User must scroll past 6 cards to even see the phone — confusing since clicking a card is supposed to change what the phone shows.

**Mobile behavior to implement**:
- Flip layout on mobile: phone mockup appears **above** the feature cards.
- Add `order-first lg:order-none` on the phone column `<div>` (currently `flex justify-center lg:justify-end`).
- Role tabs: reduce padding on mobile — `px-6 py-3` → `px-3 sm:px-6 py-2.5 sm:py-3`, add `text-xs sm:text-sm` on the label spans.
- Feature card `rounded-2xl p-4` — already fine on mobile. No change.

**Note**: The Framer Motion `layoutId="active-role-pill"` spring animation stays completely untouched. Only column order changes on mobile.

---

### 10. EmpowerSliderSection — Mobile Slide Stack

**File**: `components/sections/EmpowerSliderSection.tsx`

**Desktop behavior (KEEP AS-IS)**:
Side-by-side slider: left `55%` image panel with chevron arrows, right `45%` text with dot pagination. Auto-advances every 15 seconds.

**Problem on mobile**:
- Chevron arrows at `-left-5 md:-left-6` and `-right-5 md:-right-6` clip outside the container on mobile (-20px = hidden by `overflow-hidden` on the page).
- Section headline has no mobile font fallback — only `md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl`, no base mobile size defined.
- Dot pagination: `pt-8` is too much vertical gap on mobile.

**Mobile behavior to implement**:
- Arrow buttons: Change `-left-5 md:-left-6` → `left-3 md:-left-6` and `-right-5 md:-right-6` → `right-3 md:-right-6`. Also reduce size: `h-11 w-11` → `h-9 w-9 md:h-11 md:w-11`.
- Section headline: `text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl` (add `text-3xl` as explicit mobile base).
- Per-slide `h3` headline: `md:text-3xl` → `text-xl md:text-3xl`.
- Dot pagination: `pt-8` → `pt-4 sm:pt-8`.

---

### 11. HeroVideoSlider — Mobile Touch Controls

**File**: `components/sections/HeroVideoSlider.tsx`

**Desktop behavior (KEEP AS-IS)**:
Premium video player with Framer Motion slide transitions, custom play/pause/seek/mute/fullscreen controls, side chevron arrows that appear on `onMouseMove` hover, caption system, dot pagination below.

**Problem on mobile**:
- Chevron arrows use `onMouseMove` to appear — **on touch screens there's no mouse**, so arrows are permanently invisible and the user can never skip videos.
- Arrow positioning: `-left-5 md:-left-8` clips off-screen on mobile (same issue as EmpowerSlider).
- Caption overlay `bottom-20 left-6` can overlap the video controls bar at `bottom-0`.

**Mobile behavior to implement**:
- Make arrows always visible on mobile: use `opacity-100 md:opacity-0` as the base, then override with `md:opacity-100` when `showArrows` is true (via inline style or `cn()`). Touch screens always see the arrows.
- Arrow positioning: `left-2 md:-left-8` and `right-2 md:-right-8`.
- Caption position: `bottom-16 md:bottom-20 left-4 md:left-6`.
- Dot pagination: `mt-8` → `mt-4 sm:mt-8`.

---

### 12. DemoRequestForm — Mobile Form Layout

**File**: `components/sections/DemoRequestForm.tsx`

**Desktop behavior (KEEP AS-IS)**:
A bounded card form with 3 sections: Your Details (`grid-cols-3`), Institute Details (`grid-cols-3`), and Message. Security row with CAPTCHA + Cloudflare Turnstile. Submit button full-width.

**Problem on mobile**:
- Both form grids use `md:grid-cols-3` which correctly stacks on mobile — ✅ this part is already responsive.
- The form card uses `px-8 py-10 md:px-12 md:py-14` — `px-8` (32px horizontal padding) on a 390px screen is fine, no overflow.
- The CAPTCHA security box: `flex-col items-center gap-6 p-6` — fine on mobile.
- Section heading: `text-3xl md:text-5xl` — `text-3xl` is the mobile base, already responsive ✅.
- The two `<Chip>` badges below the submit button sit in a `flex` row — on very small screens they might wrap awkwardly.

**Mobile behavior to implement**:
- Chip row below submit button: add `flex-wrap justify-center gap-2` to allow chips to wrap cleanly instead of overflowing.
- Captcha input `max-w-[220px]`: safe on mobile — no change needed.
- Overall: mostly already responsive. Only the chip row needs a wrap fix. Audit in browser at 390px before editing.

---

### 13. TrustedInstitutionsShowcase — Mobile Marquee Scaling

**File**: `components/sections/TrustedInstitutionsShowcase.tsx`

**Desktop behavior (KEEP AS-IS)**:
An infinite auto-scrolling marquee of college logos and names. Logos are `h-[120px] w-[120px]`, wordmarks `h-[64px]`. Logos are quadruple-looped for seamless scroll. Hover pauses animation. Fade edge mask applied via CSS `mask-image`.

**Problem on mobile**:
- Logo sizes `h-[120px] md:h-[120px]` are the same on mobile and desktop — on a 390px screen, a 120px logo with 40px horizontal padding each side (`px-10 md:px-14`) means only ~2 logos visible at once, which is fine for a marquee.
- However, `px-10` (40px each side) in the `gap-4 px-10 md:gap-5 md:px-14` inner item div may make the marquee feel too spaced out on mobile.
- The container has `py-12 md:py-14` — slightly excessive vertical padding on mobile.

**Mobile behavior to implement**:
- Logo sizes: `h-[100px] w-[100px] md:h-[120px] md:w-[120px]` (already done in the code ✅ — no change needed).
- Wordmark: `h-[52px] md:h-[64px]` (already done ✅).
- Item gap/padding: `px-10 md:px-14` — the `md:` responsive is already in the code ✅.
- Container vertical padding: `py-12 md:py-14` → `py-8 md:py-14`.
- Overall: mostly already done. Only vertical padding needs tightening. Audit first.

